/target
/.idea/

# Cargo.lock IS committed here, unlike upstream.
#
# This file came from the upstream project, where ignoring the lock is the
# normal choice for a library crate. In this repository it had a concrete cost:
# openpgp/ was the ONLY workspace whose lock was untracked, so `cargo audit`
# had no pinned versions to read and could not see that openpgp/lib pulled in
# rsa 0.7.2. Dependabot saw it — from the manifest, server side — and the
# difference went unexplained until 2026-09-25. Committing the lock is what
# makes a local audit and a Dependabot alert look at the same versions.
#
# Keep it in step with the other seven workspace locks in this repo, all of
# which are tracked.
